:name: Kendryte K210 bare-metal
:description: rv64 bare-metal hello on Renode's K210 (both harts start; hart 1 parks).
$elf?=$ex_out/k210/k210_hello.elf
using sysbus
mach create "k210"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/kendryte_k210.repl
showAnalyzer uart
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
